abstract: >
  Python pipeline and harmonization codebook for comparing self-reported
  health-information confidence (HINTS 7, 2024) with directly measured adult
  literacy (PIAAC Cycle 2, 2023) in identically defined subgroups of U.S.
  adults aged 20 to 65, with an exploratory bridge to Medicaid enrollees
  through the ACS 2024 PUMS.
